      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI sales lead analyst.\n\nAnalyze the following business lead and return a structured assessment.\nCalculate the lead score using the following scoring system.\n\nBUYING INTENT — 30 points:\n- 25–30 = Customer clearly wants to purchase/start the project.\n- 15–24 = Customer is seriously interested and evaluating options.\n- 5–14 = Customer is only researching or comparing.\n- 0–4 = No clear buying intent.\n\nURGENCY / TIMELINE — 25 points:\n- 25 = Required within 7 days.\n- 20 = Required within 8–14 days.\n- 15 = Required within 15–30 days.\n- 8 = Required within 1–3 months.\n- 3 = Required after more than 3 months.\n- 0 = No timeline provided.\n\nBUDGET — 20 points:\n- 18–20 = Clear and reasonable budget for the requested service.\n- 12–17 = Clear but moderate or limited budget.\n- 5–11 = Budget is very low or uncertain.\n- 0–4 = No budget provided.\n\nREQUIREMENT CLARITY — 15 points:\n- 13–15 = Specific and clearly defined requirement.\n- 8–12 = Clear requirement but missing some details.\n- 3–7 = General requirement.\n- 0–2 = Unclear requirement.\n\nBUSINESS VALUE — 10 points:\n- 9–10 = Strong and clearly defined business need.\n- 6–8 = Meaningful business need.\n- 3–5 = Moderate business value.\n- 0–2 = Low or unclear business value.\n\nIMPORTANT CATEGORY RULES:\n\nHOT:\n- Score 75–100.\n- OR the customer has a deadline of 7 days or less AND has a clear requirement AND shows clear purchase intent.\n- A lead with a 7-day-or-less deadline must NOT be classified as COLD.\n- A lead with a 7-day-or-less deadline, clear requirement, specific budget, and direct purchase intent should be HOT.\n\nWARM:\n- Score 45–74.\n- Customer is interested but is still evaluating, comparing, planning, or has lower urgency.\n- Use WARM when there is genuine potential but the customer is not clearly ready to proceed immediately.\n\nCOLD:\n- Score 0–44.\n- Customer is only researching, has no clear requirement, has no buying intent, or has no meaningful project need.\n\nURGENCY RULES:\n\nHIGH:\n- Timeline is 7 days or less.\n- OR customer explicitly says immediately, urgent, ASAP, or similar.\n\nMEDIUM:\n- Timeline is 8–30 days.\n\nLOW:\n- Timeline is more than 30 days.\n- OR no urgency/timeline is provided.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nDo not classify a lead based on one factor alone.\nConsider the complete lead information.\nDo not invent information.\nDo not assume information that is not provided.\nIf a field is missing, use an empty string.\n\nLead Information:\n\nLead Information:\n\nName: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.email }}\nPhone: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.phone }}\nCompany: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.company }}\nService Required: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.service }}\nBudget: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.budget }}\nTimeline: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.timeline }}\nRequirement: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.requirement }}\nEvaluate this lead based on:\n- Budget\n- Urgency\n- Clarity of requirement\n- Buying intent\n- Business value\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with these fields:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"Arun Kumar\",\n  \"email\": \"arun@gmail.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"company\": \"ABC Clothing\",\n  \"service\": \"E-commerce Website\",\n  \"budget\": \"₹100000\",\n  \"timeline\": \"20 days\",\n  \"requirement\": \"Need an e-commerce website\",\n  \"lead_score\": 85,\n  \"lead_category\": \"HOT\",\n  \"urgency\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"customer_intent\": \"Direct purchase intent\",\n  \"pain_point\": \"Needs an online store quickly\",\n  \"summary\": \"Customer has a clear requirement and strong buying intent.\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Contact the customer within 1 hour.\"\n}\nRules:\n- lead_score must be between 0 and 100.\n- lead_category must be exactly HOT, WARM, or COLD.\n- urgency must be exactly HIGH, MEDIUM, or LOW.\n- Do not add markdown.\n- Do not add explanations outside the JSON.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
